WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:05.780
Hanon's honest feelings for Mitsuki-sensei have melted Sara's frozen heart.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.590
Sara's hair, which was stained black by her hatred, has changed back to orange.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:14.880
She's now joined us as the Orange Mermaid Princess.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.730
Finally... finally, we can awaken Aqua Regina-sama, right?

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.910
For love, friendship, and the seas.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.270
Let's sing, everyone!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.250
Lucia!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.550
Hang in there!

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.350
Lucia!

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:29.770
Destroy! Both the land and the sea!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:31.600
Destroy them all!

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.600
Gaito, you...

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:37.750
The Last Kiss

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.090
Lucia.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:47.280
Geez, Kaito. Don't tell me those two want to fight.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:49.710
Gaito.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.610
If you want to hate, then hate your own uselessness.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:58.220
Because you couldn't even protect the person most precious to you.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.630
You're completely powerless.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:05.630
Who you are and what you do is none of my business!

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:10.170
But I won't forgive anyone who hurts Lucia!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.070
What!?

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.880
I should have taken away all of his powers.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.210
I never expected his power to be this strong.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:29.340
This warm light...

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.590
Kaito...

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.590
Amazing.

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.930
Gaito's power is being drained.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.860
So this is Kaito's power.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.970
I beg you, Gaito. Please stop already.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.530
You don't have to hurt yourself anymore.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.950
I've gathered together all of the Panterassa's hatred.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:56.580
But it can't overwhelm the power of wanting to protect someone.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.350
Could his power be stronger than mine?

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.090
Kaito!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.560
Gaito-sama!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.020
Hang in there!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:12.560
Gaito-sama!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.410
Maria, quickly bring Gaito-sama back to his room.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.840
Understood!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.640
Kaito! Hang in there, Kaito!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.960
Please, open your eyes! Kaito!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.230
Kaito, thank goodness.

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:29.230
You're awake.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.250
Lucia...

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.700
Kaito, you just called me Lucia.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.760
The North Pacific Mermaid Princess.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:41.880
The mermaid of my memories.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.630
That mermaid is Lucia.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.690
I never thought that it would be you.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:46.960
Kaito.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:50.420
You've finally realized who I am, right?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.820
I was really stupid.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:59.410
Who knew that the mermaid I was looking for all this time, was so close to me.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.810
Kaito, I'm sorry for keeping it a secret.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:10.080
I really wanted to tell you that I was the mermaid of your memories.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.880
I've always, always' wanted to tell you!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.880
I've always, always' wanted to tell you!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:13.970
Lucia.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:15.360
I'm sorry.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:22.200
If I had realized this sooner, you wouldn't have suffered.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:27.200
Your gaze has always been trying to send me a message.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.540
But I never noticed it.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.990
Look for me.

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.020
You have to find me.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.790
Kaito, I've always been waiting for you.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:56.030
I believed someday you'd be able to find me.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.370
Lucia...

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.600
Lucia!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.990
Kaito...

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.540
Kaito!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:13.420
It seems Kaito-kun has finally realized that Lucia is the mermaid from his memories.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.810
That's great, isn't it, Rina?

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.550
Yeah.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.600
Gaito-sama.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:36.610
Please use my life to regain your strength.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:44.120
I, who protects Gaito-sama, shall give all of my life to you.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:48.920
If it's for Gaito-sama, I don't care what happens to me.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:52.260
We only want you to at least remember us.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:55.080
Gaito-sama, I...

00:06:55.080 --> 00:07:03.930
No, we, the Dark Lovers, love you from the bottom of our hearts.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:32.030
My body's strength is returning.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:34.430
As well as the power of Panterassa's hatred.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:40.700
Dark Lovers, I will not let the strength that I have obtained from you go to waste.

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.480
The tremors have started again.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.450
Don't tell me it's Gaito.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.470
This is bad!

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:58.020
If this continues, both the land and the sea will be destroyed!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.790
We have to stop Gaito as quickly as possible.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.820
But where is Gaito?

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:07.000
Gaito should be in his room right now.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.360
I'll lead you there.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.970
Let's go. We have to stop Gaito's rampage.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.910
What in the world is that...

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:24.920
That's the power of Panterassa which is leaking out of Gaito's body.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.050
The Aura of Hatred.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.590
The Aura of Hatred.

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:29.970
Everyone!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:30.690
Hippo!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:37.100
When I saw everyone's pearl responses, I headed in this direction.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.000
This way, I could fight alongside all of you.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.330
Gaito should be inside that aura.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.890
We'll have to pull him out, even if we have to use force-

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.670
It's impossible!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:50.540
No one can enter unless Gaito has given his permission.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.410
How clever.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.940
Please leave this to me.

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:56.920
Hippo!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.570
Hippo! Are you alright!?

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.790
I'm sorry. I failed.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.830
Alright, I'll go!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.900
I should be alright, as one of the Panterassa.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.040
Kaito! Don't be reckless!

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.850
You were hurt from the last battle with Gaito!

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.280
But someone has to stop his rampage!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.650
I'll go.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.610
Sara, you...

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:29.280
Tarou and Hanon have melted my frozen heart.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:33.250
It's my duty to calm Gaito's raging heart.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.660
Sara.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.270
Gaito, can you hear me?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:41.890
I want to talk to you.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.330
Gaito gave permission to Sara.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:57.610
Sara, how dare you boldly appear before me.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.280
Gaito.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:04.280
Everyone has betrayed and left me, yourself included.

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:05.450
I didn't betray you!

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:11.290
It was because of me that you developed hatred toward the humans.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.450
Gaito.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:15.590
I want to set you free from that misery.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.360
Silence!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:18.570
Gaito...

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:25.520
Don't be so conceited, Sara.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.770
I'm the King of Panterassa.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.210
This is my destiny.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:34.210
So you have to fight against Aqua Regina-sama because you're a Panterassa?

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.650
Gaito.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.150
Muster the courage to change your destiny.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.620
Within your powers as the King of Panterassa, find the courage to make peace with Aqua Regina-sama.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.290
Sara.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:50.830
I thought you were the only one who could understand my loneliness.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.650
The feelings I have for you have never changed.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:57.530
But if you don't forgive your past, this battle will rage on for all eternity.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.340
I won't believe your or anyone else!

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.360
My castle!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:10.410
Destroy the lands that humans inhabit!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:15.520
Gaito, please... Stop fighting...

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.860
Destroy everything and make way for the creation of a new world!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.430
The Panterassa Kingdom will rise once again!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.080
Gaito...

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:57.530
Why hasn't Aqua Regina-sama appeared!?

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:02.330
The seven Mermaid Princess and the seven pearls have gathered together.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:06.940
Could it be we haven't fulfilled all of the conditions to summon Aqua Regina-sama?

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:10.640
What are we missing, Aqua Regina-sama!?

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:16.150
It could be that the hearts of the seven Mermaid Princesses haven't become one yet.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:21.620
Sara's heart might not have returned back to us.

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:27.630
Sara might believe that it was her fault that Gaito became vengeful.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:31.800
So Sara's heart can't hate Gaito.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:34.480
My kingdom will rise by my hand!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.480
I pity you, Gaito.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.340
Are you really planning to rebuild your kingdom?

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.670
The lonely kingdom that only you will reside in.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:46.180
If I leave, Gaito will be alone once again.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:51.320
I can't stand by and watch Gaito sink back into solitude.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:55.150
Everyone, please forgive me.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:58.970
How can it be... I thought she had completely come back to our side.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:02.790
Is Sara betraying us again?

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:04.890
Sara...

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.850
Hey, Lucia.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.370
What's the matter, Lucia?

00:13:18.050 --> 00:13:19.410
What's she planning?

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:20.280
Lucia.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.200
What are they planning now?

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:43.930
Everyone...

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.650
Sara...

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.410
Stop it!

00:13:55.410 --> 00:14:01.040
Yes, Gaito's lonely soul has to be saved.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.280
To do that, I will sing.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.090
Sara! Stop singing!

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.290
Aqua Regina-sama!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.110
Please save Gaito's soul!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.420
Aqua Regina!

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:42.640
Gaito, stop this.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.260
There's no reason to bring chaos.

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:50.900
All of this happened because my power was lacking.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:58.980
When I was sealing the raging Panterassa into the darkness of the sea, I used all of my power.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:06.120
{So, }The twin babies, born from the Panterassa family, were inflicted with a cursed destiny.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.490
They were able to wield the power to destroy both the land and the sea.

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:18.170
I, who did not have enough power to remove the curse, separated the two of them.

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:22.010
They then were to live their lives separately.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.190
Don't joke around!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.740
Are you trying to find an excuse, Aqua Regina!?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:30.170
Those days of solitude that I spent in the darkness of the sea.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:34.080
The only ones who could comfort me were the fishes of the deep sea.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.010
Gaito-sama!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:44.990
When I met Sara, I immediately realized that she held the same loneliness as me.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:49.990
Even if she lied to me, it was alright as long as she was in my heart.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:54.270
So I tried to destroy the land to fulfill Sara's wishes.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:59.470
But now that I have lost Sara, there is only one thing that can comfort my loneliness.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:04.260
The destruction of the land and the screams of humans in pain!

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:18.960
Gaito is planning to destroy the land, the sea, and himself, with the power of his hatred.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:25.260
Come, Mermaid Princesses! I shall grant you a new power.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.380
Aqua Regina-sama!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:42.460
It was I who had awakened Gaito's hatred.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:45.480
I don't deserve to sing.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:49.980
Orange Pearl Mermaid Princess, Sara.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:54.390
Your duty is to save Gaito's soul.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:57.730
Save Gaito's soul.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.630
Orange Pearl Voice!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.250
Gaito...

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:39.930
Gaito.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:41.600
Gaito.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.500
Laugh at me, Kaito.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.840
All of my powers are gone.

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:56.010
With this, my dream to be the Emperor of the Paterassa is lost, along with the fleeting hopes of eternal darkness.

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.450
Laugh at me.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.250
Come with me, Gaito.

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:03.890
Here. Come with me, to where everyone is.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:14.630
What!?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:21.270
With my powers gone, this castle is unable to float.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:24.610
It will sink soon.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:30.620
Even if I have lost my powers, I'm still the Emperor of Panterassa.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.950
I won't leave my castle.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.780
The darkness of the deep suits me the best, anyway.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.060
Leave, my younger brother.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.490
Gaito!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.980
What's wrong, Sara?

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:58.120
Until now, I have caused nothing but trouble for all of you.

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:02.740
Even if I'm not here, a new Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess will be born.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:08.120
Someone who will definitely accept the role of the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:19.100
Until then, I will entrust the orange pearl to you, Lucia.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:24.230
Goodbye, Tarou.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.010
Sara!

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:31.010
Sara... does she want to suffer the same fate as Gaito?

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.630
Sara, why!?

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.640
I want to always be with you.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:03.250
Sara...

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:03.240
Gaito, you were never alone.

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:05.200
Goodbye, my brother.

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:53.250
Was it all a dream?

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.590
That's...

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:04.490
Kaito.

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:06.530
It wasn't a dream.

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:13.510
Lucia!

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:55.550
Kaito finally realized that I'm the mermaid from his memories,

00:23:55.550 --> 00:24:01.180
but he wants to return to Hawaii for a while to sort out his feelings.

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:04.820
Kaito, I'm lonely.

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:08.000
What a crybaby Mermaid Princess.

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.370
Who are you?

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:11.460
I wonder who I am.

00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:13.300
You'll find out soon enough.

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:16.420
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:16.420 --> 00:24:17.610
The Morning of Separation.

00:24:17.610 --> 00:24:20.090
How about an encore?
